lz-disk-cleaner for Debian
-------------------------

This package contains the LZ Disk Cleaner application,
a comprehensive disk cleaning and system optimization tool.

Building from source:
--------------------
apt build-dep lz-disk-cleaner
dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc

Or using debuild:
debuild -us -uc

Required runtime dependencies:
-----------------------------
- policykit-1: For privilege escalation
- psmisc: For process management
- lsof: For checking file locks

Configuration files:
------------------
User configuration is stored in:
~/.config/lz-disk-cleaner/

Log files are stored in:
~/.cache/lz-disk-cleaner/logs/

